	The coldblooded **Venomous Killer** lies hidden, waiting to strike when you least expect it. Whether it's a legless serpent or a huge lizard, it's not something you want to meet up close.
		**Attributes:** Art of Invisibility +2, Attack +2 (Bite) [Perks: Continued Effect x2; Flaws: Feather Blow, Low Penetration x2; 5 Endurance], Quick +1; Vulnerability −2 (Heat/Cold).
	The **Weathered Salaryman** works hard to provide for his family, and he's glad his labor has earned promotions and kept them secure. Somewhere in all those hours at his desk, though, there may have been dreams he once had. He can't remember.
		**Attributes:** Knowledge +2 (Business), Smart +1, Wealthy +2; Clumsy −1, Dull −1, Languid −1, Restricted Freedom −1 (Chained to Desk).
	The **Weird Exchange Student** really is strange. She keeps to herself, forever writing secrets in an old leather book, and during long classes she can be heard murmuring to people who aren't there.
		**Attributes:** Knowledge +2 (The Occult), Psychic +1, Spirit Medium +1; Outcast −1 (Weird Kid), Shy −2.
	Every kind of **Wild Beast** roams beyond the bustle of human society, some bigger and some faster. Take these as a starting point for exciting run-ins with nature.
		**Attributes:** Agile +2, Attack +1 (Tooth & Claw), Intimidating +2, Quick +2; Easily Distracted −1, Short-Tempered −1, Stubborn −1.
	Yuu (Plucky Pocket Monster Master)
		*"I will do anything for my sister! And with Fenrir at my side, there's nothing I can't do!"*
		*A monster-loving boy searching for his missing sister, aided by a mysterious wolf-like companion.*
		**Background**
			Yuu's beloved older sister vanished without a trace -- and, stranger still, everyone around him seems to have forgotten she ever existed. Chasing a shadowy figure fleeing the scene, Yuu instead found a caged, wolf-like creature left behind: Fenrir. Certain it was fate, Yuu freed him, and the two have been inseparable since, determined to find Yuu's sister together.
		**Personality**
			Endlessly curious and unable to leave a wrong unrighted, Yuu's good nature gets him into trouble as often as it wins him friends -- Fenrir very much included.
		**Abilities**
			Companion (Fenrir) +4
			Evasive +1
			Intuitive +1
			Iron-Willed +1
			Knowledge (Monsters) +3
			Knowledge (Video Games) +3
			Quick +2
			Unique Ability (Trust) +1
			Vigorous +1
		**Weaknesses**
			Ageism −2
			Compulsion (Finding Things Out) −2
			Guardian (Sister) −2
			Impulsive −1
			Kind-Hearted −1
			Wanted (Men in Black) −3
		**Combat**
			**Health:** 40 | **Endurance:** 50 | **Defense:** 5 | **Threat Value (TV):** 9
			**Attacks**
				**Struggle:** Roll **2 dice** | **DX 1** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Affinity: Normal Type). *Though he doesn't have any special moves, Yuu can still put up a fight if he needs to.*
		**Companion: Fenrir**
			**Abilities**
				Attack +3
				Combat Expert +2
				Quick +3
				Tough +2
				Vigorous +3
			**Weaknesses**
				Bizarre Appearance −2
				Fear (Enclosed Spaces) −2
				Guardian (Yuu) −1
				Mute −2
				Servitude (Yuu) −1
				Short-Tempered −1
			**Combat**
				**Health:** 40 | **Endurance:** 50 | **Defense:** 5 | **Threat Value (TV):** 14
				**Attacks**
					**Maul:** Roll **4 dice** | **DX 4** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Affinity: Normal Type). *Fenrir leaps at the target and attacks with beastly fury.*
					**Quick Attack:** Roll **4 dice** | **DX 4** | **Endurance Cost: 5** (Perks: Stunning; Flaws: Requirement: Trust +1 (−5)). *Fenrir strikes repeatedly in the blink of an eye.*
					**Lance:** Roll **4 dice** | **DX 7** | **Endurance Cost: 10** (Perks: Armor Piercing x2, Effective x3; Flaws: Delayed, Requirement: Trust +2 (−10)). *Fenrir charges up a skewering headbutt.*
					**Lightning Rod:** Roll **4 dice** | **DX 10** | **Endurance Cost: 15** (Affinity: Lightning; Perks: Effective x6; Flaws: Requirement: Trust +3 (−15)). *A bolt of lightning comes down from above, charging Fenrir's horn with power.*
		**Notes**
			**Fenrir and Trust** -- Fenrir has several Attacks Yuu can only use as he earns Fenrir's trust (raising his Trust Ability). Trust may also be rolled when directing Fenrir through especially complicated or dangerous tasks.
		**Fluff**
			**Concept:** Plucky Pocket Monster Master, **Birthday:** September 28, **Age:** 11, **Gender:** Male, **Height:** 4'8", **Weight:** 78 lbs., **Hair:** Pink, **Eyes:** Lavender, **Association:** Elementary School, **Hobbies:** Monsters!, **Favorite Food:** Pocky, **Allies:** Fenrir, **Enemies:** Men in Black.
	**Zombies**: you can't live with them, and they can't live without your brains. Slow and mindless, they make up for their feeble offense with sheer numbers and a refusal to stay dead.
		**Attributes:** Attack +1, Tough +2, Unique Ability +3 (Turns Defeated into Zombies); Clumsy −1, Dense −3, Slow −2, Vulnerability −2 (Fire), Vulnerability −2 (Head Shots).
	Zurkrieg
		*"Come, have at you! I will show you what real strength is!"*
		*A self-made tycoon and fighter who hunts the world's most powerful people to recruit or destroy them.*
		**Background**
			Grant Zurkrieg grew up poor in Europe and has craved power ever since. A gift for economics made him a millionaire by his mid-twenties; when money wasn't enough, he built his body into a fighting machine, and that wasn't enough either. Now his Men in Black scour the world for its most powerful people, so that he can make them join him or crush them.
		**Character Hooks**
			Anyone with remarkable skill or power can catch Zurkrieg's eye, and his lavishly funded experiments can cause trouble of their own -- as in Ai's and Yuu's backgrounds.
		**Abilities**
			Attack (Power & Control) +3
			Combat Expert +3
			Evasive +2
			Intimidating +3
			Iron-Willed +2
			Knowledge (Economics) +4
			Minions (Men in Black) +4
			Smart +2
			Strong +3
			Tough +2
			Wealthy +5
		**Weaknesses**
			Arrogant −2
			Code of Conduct (Must Have Fair Duels) −1
			Fear (Drowning, from Childhood Accident) −3
			Hatred (Weakness) −2
			Obsession (Power) −3
			Secret (Illegal Research) −3
			Stubborn −3
		**Combat**
			**NPC Type:** Heroic | **Health:** 60 | **Endurance:** 40 | **Defense:** 4 | **Threat Value (TV):** 18
			**Attacks**
				**Extending Cane:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 7** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Perks: Reach; Flaws: Weapon). *Zurkrieg's cane is engineered to extend, giving him command of any situation.*
				**The World's Strongest:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 6** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Perks: Stunning; Flaws: Ineffective, Unwieldy). *While fond enough of his cane, Zurkrieg enjoys finishing off opponents barehanded.*
	Zurkrieg's **Men in Black** are cyborgs, assembled from the terminally ill, the brain-dead, and even the dead: part human, part machine. They're slow but tireless and strong, and they carry out his orders exactly.
		**Attributes:** Strong +2, Tough +2; Emotionless −3, Servitude −3, Slow −1.
